## Features

- [Features](https://www.twipla.com/en/features): Information about TWIPLA’s 20+ interconnected tools for website statistics insights, behavior analysis, visitor communication, and eCommerce analytics.

### Website Statistics

- [Statistics Overview](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/statistics-overview): Track your website’s key performance metrics in one place.
- [Page Performance](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/page-performance): Track how pages perform as landing pages, conversion pages, and referral entry points.
- [Visitor Statistics](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/visitor-statistics): Get a visitor-by-visitor view of your traffic, including location, browsing behavior, and traffic trends over time.
- [Device Information](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/devices-information): Analyze traffic by device type, operating system, browser, and screen resolution.
- [Traffic Structure](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/traffic-structure): Track how all your digital channels are performing.
- [Outgoing Traffic](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/outgoing-traffic): See where visitors go after they leave your site.
- [Custom Dashboards](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/custom-dashboards): Customizable reports with insights from all TWIPLA tools in one place.
- [UTM Campaigns](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/utm-campaigns): Measure how well your marketing campaigns perform.
- [eCommerce Statistics](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/ecommerce-statistics): Track key performance indicators, customer purchases, and detailed sales data for your webstore.
- [Competition Analysis and Benchmarking](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/competition-analysis-benchmarking): Compare your website’s performance against competitors across industries and countries.
- [Company Reveal](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/visitors-company-reveal): Match website visitors to their business network or related company.
- [Privacy Center](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/website-statistics/privacy-center): Easily calibrate visitor data collection to business and compliance needs.

### Visitor Behavior Analytics

- [Event Tracking](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-behavior/event-tracking): Track any visitor action, even those not recorded by default, for fully customized insights.
- [Session Recordings](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-behavior/session-recordings): Watch real session videos to see how visitors navigate the site.
- [Alarming Behavior Tracking](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-behavior/alarming-behavior-tracking): Monitor visitor frustrations that point to UX issues and lost revenue opportunities.
- [Page Heatmaps](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-behavior/page-heatmaps): See how visitors interact with your webpages as a group.
- [Conversion Funnels](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-behavior/conversion-funnels): Identify bottlenecks, dropouts, and other obstacles to purchase.

### Visitor Communication

- [Polls](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-communication/polls): Create in-page questionnaires with full control over visibility and timing.
- [Surveys](https://www.twipla.com/en/features/visitor-communication/surveys): Publish off-page questionnaires and share the link anywhere.

